                responsive React applications, integrating REST APIs and
                WebSockets, and improving reliability through automated testing,
                CI/CD quality gates, observability, and production monitoring.
                Experienced in client-facing delivery, cross-functional
                collaboration, and continuous process improvement in fast-paced
                agency environments.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Core Skills</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>TypeScript, JavaScript, Node.js, React.js</li>
                <li>
                    Frontend engineering, UI development, data visualization
                </li>
                <li>Backend development, API integration, RESTful services</li>
                <li>
                    WebSockets, real-time notifications, event-driven features
                </li>
                <li>
                    Automated testing (Playwright), manual regression testing
                </li>
                <li>CI/CD integration (GitHub Actions), quality reporting</li>
                <li>
                    Docker, containerization, Dockerfile authoring, image
                    optimization
                </li>
                <li>Sentry implementation, error tracking, exception triage</li>
                <li>
                    Firebase administration, security hardening, maintenance
                    support
                </li>
                <li>
                    System monitoring, uptime alerting, email delivery
                    monitoring
                </li>
                <li>
                    Git/GitLab workflows, pull request reviews, Agile sprint
                    collaboration
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Tools and Platforms</h2>
            <p>
                React.js, TypeScript, JavaScript, Node.js, Playwright, GitHub
                Actions, GitLab, Docker, REST APIs, WebSockets, Firebase,
                Sentry, Microsoft Teams Alerts, low-code database integrations.
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>
</Layout>
